  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 403.04 Voluntary Termination. All self-insurers shall notify the department in writing at least 30 days prior to ceasing to be self-insured, and in addition to filing “Termination Notice”, form WC-100 (10/1991), in accordance with Lab 307 & 308.\n\nSource. #2264, eff 1-6-83; ss by #2935, eff 12-27-84, EXPIRED: 12-27-90\n\nNew. #5235, eff 9-27-91, EXPIRED: 9-27-97\n\nNew. #6631, INTERIM, eff 11-16-97, EXPIRED: 3-16-98\n\nNew. #6806, eff 7-18-98; ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07\n\nNew. #9019, eff 11-1-07; ss by #11066, eff 4-1-16",
